  description: The Subzero Cannon was born from military pressure to weaponize cryogenic
    research. Unlike static freezing fields, it allowed precise delivery of extreme
    cold across long distances. Early trials revealed unsettling side effects on
    organic targets, leading to ethical disputes. Despite protests, production continued
    under classified defense programs.
  vnDescription: "Subzero Cannon ra \u0111\u1EDDi t\u1EEB \xE1p l\u1EF1c qu\xE2n
    s\u1EF1 nh\u1EB1m v\u0169 kh\xED h\xF3a nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u \u0111\xF4ng l\u1EA1nh.
    Kh\xF4ng gi\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 c\xE1c tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xF3ng b\u0103ng t\u0129nh,
    n\xF3 cho ph\xE9p truy\u1EC1n t\u1EA3i ch\xEDnh x\xE1c nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED9
    c\u1EF1c l\u1EA1nh tr\xEAn kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch xa. C\xE1c th\u1EED nghi\u1EC7m
    ban \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\xE3 ti\u1EBFt l\u1ED9 nh\u1EEFng t\xE1c d\u1EE5ng ph\u1EE5
    \u0111\xE1ng lo ng\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi c\xE1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu h\u1EEFu
    c\u01A1, d\u1EABn \u0111\u1EBFn c\xE1c tranh ch\u1EA5p v\u1EC1 \u0111\u1EA1o
    \u0111\u1EE9c. B\u1EA5t ch\u1EA5p c\xE1c cu\u1ED9c bi\u1EC3u t\xECnh, vi\u1EC7c
    s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c trong khu\xF4n kh\u1ED5 c\xE1c
    ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xECnh qu\u1ED1c ph\xF2ng tuy\u1EC7t m\u1EADt."
